    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15104" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστίνδην</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄριστος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>according to birth</i> or <i>merit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱρεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					1.61
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				9(1).333.12
			</span></i> (
				Locr.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δαν</span>), Lexap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				43.57
			</span></i>, Theopomp. Hist.<i><span class="en">
				217a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθηναίων πολλοὺς ἀπολέσαντες ἀ. καὶ
					τῶν συμμάχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					3.30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				855c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἐκλογὴν ἀ. κεκριμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.10.9
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλουτίνδην,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1273a23
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ath.</u>
				3.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				13
			</span></i>.</div>
